      "workflow_quirks_noted": [
        "LLP_Creation_Module: A workflow trigger overwrites Total_Units to 1 and recomputes Pet_Unit_Price = Total_Project_Cost / 1 if Total_Project_Cost is set. Workaround: omit Total_Project_Cost / Total_Ticket_Size / Acreage_Acres from create payloads. Use 2-step pattern: bare create with Name only, then update with financial fields.",
        "LLP_UnitAllocation_Module: Total_Amount_Received is computed by trigger as Token_Advance_Amount + sum(Amount_1..10). Direct writes to Total_Amount_Received are reverted. Use Token_Advance_Amount + Amount_N + UTR + Date_N to drive the value.",
        "Capital_Invested can be set directly and is not overwritten by trigger.",
        "Both modules: workflow may have been generated by an LLM via MCP \u2014 should be reviewed by CRM admin to ensure intended behaviour for production."
      ]
